    "description": "<p><strong>Vibe Chillin’ </strong>是一家无酒精珍珠奶茶与冰柠檬茶吧，为那些渴望叛逆却不想宿醉的Z世代后浪和永葆童心的年轻人而生。</p><p>在这里，你可以毫不费力地酷、轻度搞乱、完全清醒——一种真正的“kidult”轻奢体验，拒绝成人世界的装逼与班味。</p><p>朋克字体、暗黑哥特氛围、街头潮服态度与戏谑不恭的细节，共同打造了一个像地下俱乐部一样酷的茶吧——但只卖奶茶和柠檬茶。</p><p>酒嗨老登止步。这里只有纯粹、不认输的vibe。</p><p><strong>品牌洞察</strong></p><p>当代年轻人渴望叛逆与个性表达的空间，但传统夜生活以酒精为中心、年龄限制严格、充满表演式“成人感”，让他们感到疏离。他们需要既排外又安全、既酷又包容的地方——连未成年朋友也能一起玩。</p><p><strong>品牌定位</strong></p><p>最酷的无酒精聚集地，用珍珠奶茶和冰柠檬茶提供地下俱乐部级别的能量。</p><p>叛逆但无害，轻奢却不疏远——为只想狠狠vibe又不想喝酒的人打造的kidult乌托邦。</p><p><strong>目标人群</strong></p><p>核心：Z世代后浪（16-25岁），高中生、大学生、年轻创意人群</p><p>次级：拒绝“老登口味”和班味的童心未泯千禧一代（25-35岁）</p><p><strong>品牌个性</strong></p><p>轻度搞乱、不恭、毫不费力地酷、微朋克、暗黑轻奢、戏谑叛逆、包容却又带点排外感</p><p><strong>核心视觉要素</strong></p><p>Typography: Custom gothic-blackletter logo with sharp serifs and subtle spikes → conveys rebellion + luxury</p><p>Color palette: Deep black, burgundy, metallic silver/gold, neon accents (green, purple, red)</p><p>Imagery style: High-contrast dramatic lighting, streetwear models, punk accessories, surreal details (floating boba, burning tote bags, alien abductions)</p><p>Tone of voice: Sarcastic, playful, anti-pretension (“No wine snobs allowed”, “Adult beverage? Nah.”)</p><p><strong>品牌承诺与体验</strong></p><p>离开时你会感觉更酷、更轻松、更被连接——没有宿醉，只有满满的vibe。</p><p>一个庆祝年轻（或童心）的地方，叛逆以一杯完美调制的奶茶呈现，而非烈酒。</p><p><strong>差异化策略</strong></p><p>不同于普通奶茶店（休闲、家庭友好）或酒吧（必须喝酒、成人专属），Vibe Chillin’ 占据了一个独一无二的位置：</p><p>高能量夜生活氛围 + 无酒精 + 年轻人专属态度 + 轻奢执行</p>",
    "credits": {
      "Brand Director": "Zeno Huang"
    },
    "gallery_layout": "stack",
    "image_gap": 0,
    "description_en": "<p><strong>Vibe Chillin’ </strong>is a non-alcoholic boba &amp; iced lemon tea bar designed for the post Gen-Z and young-at-heart who crave rebellion without the hangover.</p><p>It’s a space where you can be effortlessly cool, slightly mischievous, and completely sober — a true “kidult” luxury experience that rejects adult pretension and office vibes.</p><p>Punk typography, dark gothic ambiance, streetwear attitude, and playful irreverence come together to create a tea house that feels like the coolest underground club — but serves only milk tea and lemon tea.</p><p>No wine snobs allowed. Just pure, unapologetic vibe.</p><p><strong>Brand Insight</strong></p><p>Today’s youth want spaces to express rebellion and individuality, but many feel alienated by traditional nightlife’s alcohol-centric culture, age restrictions, and performative “adulting”. They seek places that feel exclusive and edgy yet safe and inclusive — even for underage friends.</p><p><strong>Brand Positioning</strong></p><p>The coolest non-alcoholic hangout that delivers underground club energy through boba and iced lemon tea.</p><p>Rebellious yet harmless, luxurious yet approachable — a kidult sanctuary for those who want to vibe hard without drinking.</p><p><strong>Target Audience</strong></p><p>Primary: Post Gen-Z (16-25岁), high school &amp; university students, young creatives</p><p>Secondary: Young-at-heart millennials (25-35岁) who reject “adult taste” and office culture</p><p><strong>Brand Personality</strong></p><p>Mischievous, irreverent, effortlessly cool, slightly punk, darkly luxurious, playfully rebellious, inclusive yet exclusive-feeling</p><p><strong>Key Visual Elements</strong></p><p>Typography: Custom gothic-blackletter logo with sharp serifs and subtle spikes → conveys rebellion + luxury</p><p>Color palette: Deep black, burgundy, metallic silver/gold, neon accents (green, purple, red)</p><p>Imagery style: High-contrast dramatic lighting, streetwear models, punk accessories, surreal details (floating boba, burning tote bags, alien abductions)</p><p>Tone of voice: Sarcastic, playful, anti-pretension (“No wine snobs allowed”, “Adult beverage? Nah.”)</p><p><strong>Brand Promise &amp; Experience</strong></p><p>You will leave feeling cooler, lighter, and more connected — with zero hangover and full vibe.</p><p>A space where being young (or young-minded) is celebrated, and rebellion comes in the form of perfectly crafted boba instead of shots.</p><p><strong>Competitive Differentiation</strong></p><p>Unlike regular boba shops (casual, family-friendly) or bars (alcohol-required, adult-only), Vibe Chillin’ occupies a unique space:</p><p>High-energy nightlife vibe + non-alcoholic + youth-exclusive attitude + luxury execution</p>",
