    "description": "<p><span style=\"color: rgb(105, 105, 105);\">Vondara Marble is a conceptual luxury engineered jade stone brand crafted for the era of “Quiet Luxury” and global material renaissance.</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(105, 105, 105);\">We reimagined engineered stone not as a mere building material, but as a medium of light, narrative, and rebirth. Through meticulous texture refinement, dynamic light-shadow orchestration, and curatorial exhibition thinking, every slab becomes an art installation that breathes aura and timelessness.</span></p><p><br></p><p>From the logo symbolizing rooted innovation and luminous growth, to the jade-green visual system and golden-vein details, the entire identity system is designed to transcend the conventional “per-square-meter” mindset, speaking directly to high-end spatial designers, hotel owners, museum curators, and commercial developers who value aesthetic premium and emotional depth.</p><p>This is not just a product — it is a silent revolution in stone.</p>",
    "credits": {
      "Creative Director": "Zeno Huang"
    },
    "gallery_layout": "stack",
    "image_gap": 0,
    "description_en": "<p><span style=\"color: rgb(105, 105, 105);\">Vondara Marble is a conceptual luxury engineered jade stone brand crafted for the era of “Quiet Luxury” and global material renaissance.</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(105, 105, 105);\">We reimagined engineered stone not as a mere building material, but as a medium of light, narrative, and rebirth. Through meticulous texture refinement, dynamic light-shadow orchestration, and curatorial exhibition thinking, every slab becomes an art installation that breathes aura and timelessness.</span></p><p><br></p><p>From the logo symbolizing rooted innovation and luminous growth, to the jade-green visual system and golden-vein details, the entire identity system is designed to transcend the conventional “per-square-meter” mindset, speaking directly to high-end spatial designers, hotel owners, museum curators, and commercial developers who value aesthetic premium and emotional depth.</p><p>This is not just a product — it is a silent revolution in stone.</p>",
