    "description": "<p>LinCoffee 致力于呈现东方咖啡与茶的独特魅力，融合自然的馈赠与传统的智慧。从云南的高山到您的杯中，每一滴都传递着原始的醇香与独特的风土。我们秉承东方的优雅与和谐，精心萃取每一颗咖啡豆，让您在每一次啜饮中感受到自然的美好与生活的宁静。</p>",
    "credits": {
      "Creative Director": "Zeno Huang"
    },
    "gallery_layout": "stack",
    "image_gap": 0,
    "description_en": "<p>LinCoffee is dedicated to showcasing the unique charm of Oriental coffee and tea, blending the gifts of nature with traditional wisdom. From the high mountains of Yunnan to your cup, every drop conveys the original richness and distinctive terroir. We embrace the elegance and harmony of the East, carefully extracting each coffee bean to bring you the beauty of nature and the tranquility of life in every sip.</p>",
    "slug": "lincoffee",
